{"v":4,"catch":"可愛到令人毛骨悚然的外星人","desc":"《BARADUKE 2》是 NAMCO（萬代南夢宮娛樂公司）於 1988 年發行的動作射擊遊戲。\n在前作《BARADUKE》中，螃蟹般的“OCTY”並沒有完全從他們的堡壘中消滅。\n依靠您在上一款遊戲中救出的 PACCET 的幫助，完成消滅邪惡的 OCTY 外星人的使命！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2023-08-03","genres":["動作","射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5dfb6524d0960b2d3eab39e0dd3c96581a98c3716339ee87804884a40f58615c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a0ccfde6f519c9e1b08d5d156fb581d9da827ff4ed128064f8bb82e9bc12113b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f3c2e14b0267f6bd2c73eaa1d395f2425563d1c4e87e6d6758489a41df8f5eb5.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/db7df00e93924486516166ec6ccf74b6d158eea889b763cdef77f60123e5e9e6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/46f6b55558ec9d7732d0be173bcb325d64ed19dc1e38a4eb5bbeed77ca005a34.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8dee12988e63c629c5e6ae5c1c458c899e6572a5ea413eb5f2b9b82348ff4132.jpg"],"titleId":"01008af01af98000","dlc":[]}